This list contains the top 50 accounts with the most followers on the social photo-sharing platform [[Instagram]].<ref name="Socialblade">{{Cite web|url=https://socialblade.com/instagram/top/100/followers|title=Top 100 Instagram Users by Followers- Socialblade Instagram Stats - Instagram Statistics|work=Socialblade|accessdate=October 3, 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171005083659/https://socialblade.com/instagram/top/100/followers|archive-date=October 5, 2017|dead-url=yes|df=mdy-all}}</ref> As of December 2018, the most followed user is Instagram's own account, with over 272 million followers. [[Cristiano Ronaldo]] is the most followed individual, with over 149 million followers. 13 accounts have exceeded 100 million followers on the site.

